  "dct_description_sm": [
    "This data was collected in order to measure the discharge in water tracks networks, which are zones of preferential subsurface flow, and at the front of a perennial snowdrift. It provides a rare measurement of preferential subsurface flow in periglacial environments, showing the hydrological function of patterned ground in flowpath establishment."
